### 1. 注册一个新用户 (假设叫 Alice)
POST http://localhost:8080/user/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "Alice",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 2. Alice 登录 (获取 Token)
# @name loginAlice
POST http://localhost:8080/api/user/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "Alice",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 3. Alice 创建一个房间 (注意替换 {{token}} 为上一步返回的 token)
# 这一步会触发 JWT 拦截器
@aliceToken = {{loginAlice.response.body.data.token}}

POST http://localhost:8080/api/room/create
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{aliceToken}}

{
  "roomName": "Alice的音乐派对",
  "mediaUrl": "http://music.163.com/song/media/outer/url?id=12345.mp3",
  "coverUrl": "http://example.com/cover.jpg"
}

### 4. 获取历史房间记录 (依然需要 Token)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/room/history?userId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{aliceToken}}